        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW01002R, 2-3/4 Inch Round Smooth Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large round rosette can be added to door handles to make them even more dramatic and decorative. The 2-3/4 Inch Round Door Pull Rosette is easy to install. Available in many different finishes to compliment and match your door pulls. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-inch-decorative-reed-rosette-first-impressions-bst03002r\"><b>Decorative Reed Rosette</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions DLW01002R Delaware Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Forged Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA door pull typically has at least two mounting points, so you need to order a rosette for each mount point.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
